[I] A linter for YAML files

[T] yamllint is a linter for YAML files written in Python. It checks not
[T] only syntax validity but also weirdnesses like key repetition and
[T] cosmetic problems such as line length, trailing spaces and indentation,
[T] configurable through rule sets.

[U] https://github.com/adrienverge/yamllint

[A] Yamllint Authors
